<title>USA: Nasdaq closing most actives - Oct 16.</title>
<headline>Nasdaq closing most actives - Oct 16.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following were the most active issues in Nasdaq trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>  Sun Microsystems  17,984,900	 63 1/8     off  6 7/8</p>
<p>  U.S. Robotics     13,604,500	 77 5/8	up    3/8</p>
<p>  Intel Corp	  10,828,400	112 5/8	up  1 1/2</p>
<p>  Amgen		  8,104,200	 58 1/2	up  1 1/8</p>
<p>  Imega		  7,744,000	 25 13/16    up  1 1/2</p>
<p>  MCI		    5,853,800	 24 1/2     off    5/8</p>
<p>  Cisco		  4,700,200	 65 3/8     off    1/2</p>
<p>  Memco		  4,368,100	 19	    up  4</p>
<p>  Atmel		  4,163,200	 29 3/4     off    5/8</p>
<p>  VLSI		   3,965,400	 18 3/4	up    3/8</p>
<p>Volume: 546,750,300</p>
